%N A158008 Positive integers for which Bauer's identical congruence holds.
%C A158008 Holds for odd primes and 1,4,6,10,34,514; no more composite members below 10000. - _Charles R Greathouse IV_, Apr 23 2010
%H A158008 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/BauersIdenticalCongruence.html">Bauer's Identical Congruence</a>.
%t A158008 Select[Range[100], Function[n, n === 1 || PolynomialMod[Times @@ (x - Select[Range[n - 1], CoprimeQ[#, n] &]) - x^EulerPhi[n] + 1, n] === 0]] (* _Eric W. Weisstein_, Oct 06 2026 *)
